l,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123547","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123547","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123547.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123547.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- The LSP has a GDScriptParser subclass, however there isn't really any reason to use inheritance since it does not override anything. It just parses normally and then processes the results. This PR replaces the inheritance relationship with just having a `GDScriptParser`\r\n- Fixes some IMO architectural debt, but primarily the fact that `GDScriptParser` has subclasses has been an issue for something I'm working on (reworking ownership and management of external parser i.e. replacing `GDScriptParserRef`) and it made sense to split this out since it is a self contained change.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI've started addressing AST nodes using an `AST` typedef (so `AST::ClassNode` over `GDScriptParser::ClassNode`). This IMO helps with readability.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123547/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123547/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}